    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-IIreg5">
        <head xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Hd1e98">Caput 5</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIreg5-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIreg5_1@1-1">Naaman,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e113">Gentiles significat <pb ed="#P" n="0614A"/> virtute bellorum principatum gerentes, ac rerum decore fruentes. Unde Naaman decus sive commotio eorum interpretatur: vir fortis et dives, sed leprosus; quia quamvis per potentiam regni ac rerum abundantiam dominari videretur: tamen per errorem idololatriae lepra foedus apparuit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Dd1e120">
          <head xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Hd1e122">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIreg5-d1e124">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e126" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIreg5_2@1-3">Porro de Syria.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e129"><name xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Nd1e130" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e133"><seg type="qs">Latrunculi de Syria</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sicut in Evangelio princeps sacerdotum fecit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIreg5-d1e141">
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e143" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/IIreg5_2@1-3"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e145"><name xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Nd1e146" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e149"><seg type="qs">Et Dominus <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e152" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom8_30@1-6">quos praescivit, hos et vocavit,</quote> etc. Veniens gentilis populus ad domum Elisaei</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia baptizatos oportet Dominici corporis participatione confirmari.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Dd1e161">
          <head xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Hd1e163">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIreg5-d1e165">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e167" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIreg5_17@12-13">Tollam onus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e170"><name xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Nd1e171" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e174">Partem sanctae terrae secum tulit Naaman ut poneret in templo idolorum, <pb ed="#P" n="0614B"/> et super eam consistens, Dominum cujus erat terra, adoraret, ne offenderet Dominum suum si pariter non adoraret.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Hd1e183">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-IIreg5-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIreg5_20@2-2">Giezi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Rd1e190"><name xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Nd1e191" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-IIreg5-Qd1e194"><seg type="qs">Praeruptum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hic est canis reversus ad vomitum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
